# Asset URLs

Next.js serves files from `public/` at `/`. A rewrite also keeps Jekyll-style `/public/...` working.

In **post/case-study HTML**, keep Liquid so `lib/html.ts` can resolve it:

```liquid
{{ 'public/uploads/2026/09/example.png' | relative_url }}
```

In **React**, use `next/image` with `/uploads/...` (no `public/` prefix).

Lightbox: `data-magnific-image` (posts) and `data-magnific-gallery` (Journey).
